ue},{"a":52436,"n":"library_text_msgs_0_3","k":"table","len":84,"c":true},{"a":52520,"n":"library_text_msgs_4_7","k":"table","len":67,"c":true},{"a":52587,"n":"library_text_msgs_8_10","k":"table","len":58,"c":true},{"a":52645,"n":"library_last_byte","k":"variable","len":1,"c":true}],"records":[{"a":0,"t":"gap","n":51712},{"a":51712,"l":"library","c":"Location module 2, the library, where skills are learned for skill points. The game runs it for a square whose action record (at $5F/$60) starts with $82 (game $8845: JSR $03BF with A = 2, then JSR $CA00). Keeps the picture state $AB/$AC on the stack, copies the library's name, record bytes 4-15, to the location name at $F4D0 and shows picture 2 from the buffer at $E000 ($041C). The loop at $CA1A: roster shown, the greeting (the map message record byte 3 names, print_map_message), 'Who wants to enter?' (pick_member, asked even in a party of one); a member who is not conscious is 'in no condition to learn'. Otherwise the member's roster line is highlighted, the text window opened and the loop at $CA59 runs: no skill points (+$20): 'You have too much on your mind to learn anything.'; no empty skill pair among the 30: 'Not even Einstein can learn anymore.'; nothing on offer that the member's IQ allows (count_offered_skills): '... is not smart enough to learn anything here.'; else the list (header '   IQ PTS LVL   SKILL', one skill_list_line per skill), the skill points and list_choose. A skill chosen (record byte $0F + item): its base cost must not exceed the points (unsigned, $CAA5), else 'Not enough skill points!'. A skill the member lacks goes into the first empty pair at level 1 for the base cost ($CB1C). One the member has: level 255 'You know it all.', a level not below the rank (+$24) 'Need more experience.'; otherwise the cost is base x 2^level (level_cost, 255 when larger) and the points left are tested with SBC/BMI ($CB03): a remainder of 128 or more is refused, and a cost more than 128 above the points wraps to a small positive remainder that becomes the new points (cost 255 adds one point, 192 adds 64). Each success flashes the line, and the list returns while points remain. Left-arrow at the member question leaves: $AB/$AC put back, the map stream the picture overwrote unpacked again ($03C5), carry set, so the game redraws ($8872 -> $AC8C). It never saves the game.","t":"code","b":[165,171],"m":"lda","o":"picture_number","oa":171},{"a":51714,"t":"code","b":[72],"m":"pha"},{"a":51715,"t":"code","b":[165,172],"m":"lda","o":"picture_animating","oa":172},{"a":51717,"t":"code","b":[72],"m":"pha"},{"a":51718,"t":"code","b":[160,4],"m":"ldy","o":"#$04"},{"a":51720,"t":"code","b":[162,0],"m":"ldx","o":"#$00"},{"a":51722,"l":"b_CA0A","t":"code","b":[177,95],"m":"lda","o":"(map_record_ptr),y","oa":95,"x":[51731]},{"a":51724,"t":"code","b":[157,208,244],"m":"sta","o":"picture_caption,x","oa":62672},{"a":51727,"t":"code","b":[200],"m":"iny"},{"a":51728,"t":"code","b":[232],"m":"inx"},{"a":51729,"t":"code","b":[224,12],"m":"cpx","o":"#$0C"},{"a":51731,"t":"code","b":[208,245],"m":"bne","o":"b_CA0A","oa":51722},{"a":51733,"t":"code","b":[169,2],"m":"lda","o":"#$02"},{"a":51735,"t":"code","b":[32,28,4],"m":"jsr","o":"api_show_picture_e000","oa":1052},{"a":51738,"l":"library_who_enters","t":"code","b":[32,183,2],"m":"jsr","o":"api_roster_show","oa":695,"x":[51773,51812,51827,51909,51937,52042]},{"a":51741,"t":"code","b":[160,3],"m":"ldy","o":"#$03"},{"a":51743,"t":"code","b":[177,95],"m":"lda","o":"(map_record_ptr),y","oa":95},{"a":51745,"t":"code","b":[32,23,3],"m":"jsr","o":"api_print_map_message","oa":791},{"a":51748,"t":"code","b":[169,5],"m":"lda","o":"#$05"},{"a":51750,"t":"code","b":[32,83,204],"m":"jsr","o":"library_print_wrapped","oa":52307},{"a":51753,"t":"code","b":[32,174,2],"m":"jsr","o":"api_pick_member","oa":686},{"a":51756,"t":"code","b":[201,0],"m":"cmp","o":"#$00"},{"a":51758,"t":"code","b":[240,16],"m":"beq","o":"library_leave","oa":51776},{"a":51760,"t":"code","b":[1